    help_html:"<div class=\"help\"><div class=\"hr\"><div class=\"hk\">Start</div><div class=\"hv\"><div class=\"hn\">⚙ → Base URL and MAPI-Key → Test connection</div><div class=\"hn\">Pick language and design code in the header — TWN-USD112 · GB 50010-2010 · KDS 41 20 00</div><div class=\"hn\">Confirmation card and 3D preview work before connecting to Gen NX</div></div></div><div class=\"hr\"><div class=\"hk\">Build</div><div class=\"hv\"><div class=\"hc\"><code>build 15-story apartment</code><code>build 20-story office 2 buildings</code><code>build custom frame</code></div><div class=\"hn\">[Edit] on the card → typical floors, sections, material, slab, seismic/wind → [Run]</div></div></div><div class=\"hr\"><div class=\"hk\">Sections & spec</div><div class=\"hv\"><div class=\"hc\"><code>change all columns to 700x700</code><code>enlarge floor 3 columns to 700x700</code><code>change stories to 20</code><code>change floor height to 3500</code><code>change material to C350</code></div></div></div><div class=\"hr\"><div class=\"hk\">Analysis</div><div class=\"hv\"><div class=\"hc\"><code>run analysis</code><code>response spectrum analysis</code><code>review indicators</code></div><div class=\"hn\">Static → eigen + response spectrum with code scaling (TW 3.2/3.3 · GB min. shear-weight ratio · KDS 0.85V)</div><div class=\"hn\">Review — GB 审图 · KDS drift, torsional irregularity, design category</div></div></div><div class=\"hr\"><div class=\"hk\">Results</div><div class=\"hv\"><div class=\"hc\"><code>show max displacement</code><code>show reactions</code><code>show member forces</code><code>show bending moment</code><code>status summary</code></div></div></div><div class=\"hr\"><div class=\"hk\">View</div><div class=\"hv\"><div class=\"hc\"><code>show 3D</code><code>show results</code><code>model tab</code></div><div class=\"hn\">3D toolbar — iso/front/side/top (orthographic), toggle columns/beams/nodes/floor lines</div><div class=\"hn\">Drag the chat|panel divider to resize · theme buttons (Dark/Light/Cyan) at the bottom</div></div></div><div class=\"hr\"><div class=\"hk\">AI mode</div><div class=\"hv\"><div class=\"hn\">AI (top right) → provider, model, API key → turn on Use LLM</div><div class=\"hn\">Natural-language modeling, analysis and review, view control (“plan view, zoom 2x”), result queries (“top 5 axial forces”)</div></div></div><div class=\"hr\"><div class=\"hk\">Sharing</div><div class=\"hv\"><div class=\"hn\">Append /ko/ · /en/ · /zh-TW/ · /zh-CN/ to open the link (and its preview) in that language</div></div></div><div class=\"hr\"><div class=\"hk\">Other</div><div class=\"hv\"><div class=\"hc\"><code>check connection</code><code>clear model</code><code>help</code></div><div class=\"hn\">Clicking a menu item on the left types the command and runs it</div></div></div></div>",
